{"nodes": [{"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_diagram", "label": "How Galedra Checks a Meme (animated flow infographic)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "svg <title>/<desc>, 2048x682 banner", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Subtitle 'From chat question to permanent evidence record' frames the whole pipeline: the deliverable is an auditable record, not a verdict. Built as a baked-in WebP raster overlaid with live SVG text so wording can be corrected without regenerating the artwork; CSS keyframes light each of the five stages in a 12s loop with a prefers-reduced-motion fallback."}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_meme_post_clean_energy", "label": "Shared social post: 'Clean energy already powers 50% of the world!'", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "steps 1 and 5 post cards", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step1_user_asks_llm", "label": "Step 1: User asks an LLM to check a meme", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "step highlight #s1 (x=20,y=134); caption group step1-caption-fix", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The SVG overlay replaces the baked-in 'asks an LLM to fact-check it' wording with 'The user shares a post and asks an LLM to check its claims against evidence.' \u2014 Galedra is a record of traceable reasons, not a fact-checking verdict service."}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step2_llm_extracts_atomic_claims", "label": "Step 2: LLM extracts atomic claims", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "step highlight #s2 (x=380,y=118); 'Atomic claims found:' panel", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The connected assistant, not the server, does the extraction: the LLM breaks the meme into simple, checkable claims before anything is written to the ledger."}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step3_galedra_stores_permanent_record", "label": "Step 3: Galedra stores an auditable permanent record", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "step highlight #s3 (x=704,y=102), the widest panel; scan/centerPulse animation", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Given the widest panel (627px vs ~310px for the others) and its own scanning/pulse animation because it is the only stage Galedra itself performs; each claim is checked against sources, linked to evidence, and stored as a traceable record."}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step4_evidence_reconstructed_into_answer", "label": "Step 4: Atomic evidence is reconstructed into an answer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "step highlight #s4 (x=1362,y=116); group corrected-content answer card", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Galedra reassembles the atomic elements into a clear, sourced response \u2014 the inverse of step 2's decomposition, and the reason the record must be per-claim rather than per-meme."}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step5_user_responds_to_original_post", "label": "Step 5: User responds to the original post", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "step highlight #s5 (x=1698,y=133); 'I checked this in Galedra \u2014 here's what the evidence shows.'", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The loop closes back at the social post: the payoff is the user replying with an informed, evidence-based response that links to the record instead of repeating a rumour."}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_atomic_claims_panel", "label": "Atomic claims panel (Claim A, Claim B, Statistic C, Quote D)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "'Atomic claims in' panel bridging steps 2 and 3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The panel visually straddles the step 2 / step 3 boundary: the same four atomic claims are the handoff object between the assistant and the ledger."}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_claim_a", "label": "Claim A: 'Clean energy already powers 50% of the world.'", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "step 2 'Atomic claims found' list", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_claim_b", "label": "Claim B: 'This is higher than fossil fuels in many countries.'", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "step 2 'Atomic claims found' list", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_statistic_c", "label": "Statistic C: '50% of global power comes from clean energy.'", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "step 2 'Atomic claims found' list", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_quote_d", "label": "Quote D: 'Experts say the transition is mostly complete.'", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "step 2 'Atomic claims found' list", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_evidence_graph", "label": "Evidence graph", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "right-hand panel inside step 3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_sources", "label": "Sources \u2014 trusted and diverse", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "evidence graph panel, row 1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "'Trusted and diverse' is the diagram's shorthand for independence: diversity of lineage, not count of citations, is what the score keys on."}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_evidence", "label": "Evidence \u2014 links to original material", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "evidence graph panel, row 2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_support_contradict", "label": "Support / Contradict \u2014 shows how evidence relates to each claim", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "evidence graph panel, row 3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_permanent_record", "label": "Permanent record \u2014 traceable, auditable, everlasting", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "step 3 centre, 'Permanent record / TRACEABLE \u00b7 AUDITABLE \u00b7 EVERLASTING' plus evidence graph row 4 'Stored for future review'", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Drawn as a database cylinder at the hub of the node graph: append-only storage is the centre of the pipeline, and everything else is either input to it or read out of it."}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_evidence_summary_card", "label": "Evidence summary card", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "group corrected-content, rect x=1388 y=211", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "This whole card is drawn in live SVG on top of the raster specifically to overwrite the baked-in 'Meme fact-check / Verdict: Mostly False / Confidence: High' artwork, which used vocabulary the project forbids."}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_assessment_leans_contradicted", "label": "Assessment: Leans contradicted", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "answer card, pill at x=1527 y=286", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Uses the canonical assessment_state LEANS_CONTRADICTED in place of a 'Mostly False' verdict, and states a reason ('overstates the evidence and collapses distinct energy categories') rather than a truth label."}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_why_bullets", "label": "Why \u2014 reasons behind the assessment", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "answer card 'Why' section: clean electricity ~30% not 50%; regional grids differ; the claim merges several categories", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_independent_lineages", "label": "4 sources, 2 independent lineages", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "answer card footer, text at x=1433 y=463", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Surfacing lineage count next to source count makes no-double-counting visible: four citations sharing two origins are not four independent supports."}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_review_checks", "label": "Review checks: 3 of 4", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "answer card footer, text at x=1433 y=482", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Review coverage shown as a fraction rather than a confidence bar: it reports how much of the checklist was actually done, so an incomplete check cannot read as high confidence."}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_brand_line_traceable_reasons", "label": "Tagline: CLAIMS \u00b7 EVIDENCE \u00b7 TRACEABLE REASONS", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "corrected-content, text x=1041 y=198", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A dark rect is painted over the baked-in logo area so the raster's 'CLAIMS. EVIDENCE. A CLEARER TRUTH.' can be replaced with 'TRACEABLE REASONS' \u2014 Galedra is a source of traceable reasons for believing or doubting a claim, never a source of truth."}, {"id": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_canonical_vocabulary_overlay", "label": "Live SVG overlay correcting baked-in vocabulary", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "groups corrected-content and step1-caption-fix over the embedded WebP at line 186", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The artwork is a generated raster that used forbidden synonyms (verdict, mostly false, confidence, a clearer truth, fact-check). Rather than regenerate it, three vector patches blend over the logo strip, the step 4 card and the step 1 caption, so the rendered banner speaks only canonical vocabulary and can be re-edited as text."}], "edges": [{"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_diagram", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step1_user_asks_llm", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "#s1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_diagram", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step2_llm_extracts_atomic_claims", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "#s2", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_diagram", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step3_galedra_stores_permanent_record", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "#s3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_diagram", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step4_evidence_reconstructed_into_answer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "#s4", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_diagram", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step5_user_responds_to_original_post", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "#s5", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step1_user_asks_llm", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step2_llm_extracts_atomic_claims", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "arrow group .progress1, path M350,309 -> 410,309", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step2_llm_extracts_atomic_claims", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step3_galedra_stores_permanent_record", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "arrow group .progress2, path M668,309 -> 732,309", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step3_galedra_stores_permanent_record", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step4_evidence_reconstructed_into_answer", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "arrow group .progress3, path M1309,309 -> 1370,309", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step4_evidence_reconstructed_into_answer", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step5_user_responds_to_original_post", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "arrow group .progress4, path M1683,309 -> 1742,309", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step1_user_asks_llm", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_meme_post_clean_energy", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "step 1 post card, 'Check this meme before I repost it.'", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step5_user_responds_to_original_post", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_meme_post_clean_energy", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "step 5 reply card, 'I checked this in Galedra'", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step2_llm_extracts_atomic_claims", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_atomic_claims_panel", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "'Atomic claims found:' to 'Atomic claims in'", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_atomic_claims_panel", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_claim_a", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_atomic_claims_panel", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_claim_b", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_atomic_claims_panel", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_statistic_c", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_atomic_claims_panel", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_quote_d", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_claim_a", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_meme_post_clean_energy", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "Claim A restates the post's headline sentence verbatim", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step3_galedra_stores_permanent_record", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_atomic_claims_panel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "panel sits inside highlight #s3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step3_galedra_stores_permanent_record", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_evidence_graph", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "panel sits inside highlight #s3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_step3_galedra_stores_permanent_record", "target": "app_assets_images_how_galedra_checks_a_meme_permanent_record", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/assets/images/how-galedra-checks-a-meme.svg", "source_location": "'Permanent record / TRACEABLE \u00b7 AUDITABLE \u00b7 EVERLASTING'", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_assets_image